"""Western Europe: Rome and Italy, France, Spain, Portugal, Britain, Scotland, Ireland, the Netherlands, Belgium,
Luxembourg, Switzerland, Germany, Austria and Malta. Rome and its empire are at home in Italy, the Franks and
Charlemagne in France, the Holy Roman Empire in Germany, the Habsburg monarchy in Austria; the Angevin Empire and
England's French lands are Britain's."""
from _lib import L, P

